# shir_nodes/spread.node — Spread: expand a list into individual
# arguments/elements (`f(args...)` variadic spread, JS `...arr`,
# Zig/Java varargs pass-through).
#
# GENERIC. VALID ONLY where the host surface allows a spread: direct
# call arguments and collection-literal elements (ESTree restricts
# SpreadElement the same way). A frontend emitting it elsewhere gets a
# generator error — Refuse > guess at the emit layer.
#
# Relation to the existing Python-flavored `Splice` node: same runtime
# effect; Splice predates this node (Python slice-splice idiom) and
# stays for its transform consumers. New frontends should prefer this
# neutral name.

node Spread
tag "Spread"
kind expr
# storage_class str_bounded
field expr: expr
